# Go 项目标准行尾：统一 LF，避免 Windows CRLF 导致 gofmt -l 失真与 git 换行警告
* text=auto
*.go       text eol=lf
*.mod      text eol=lf
*.sum      text eol=lf
*.proto    text eol=lf
*.yml      text eol=lf
*.yaml     text eol=lf
*.md       text eol=lf
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.sql      text eol=lf
*.bat      text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg binary
*.pem binary